ilah ke Lost Tower Level 3. Kalahkan 50 Cursed Wizards dan 50 Death Cows, dan aku akan memberimu Iris Helm + 7 dan Iris Pants + 7 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 4 and defeat 50 Death Cows and 30 Devils. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 dan kalahkan 50 Death Cows dan 30 Devils. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 4. Defeat 50 Death Cows and 30 Devils, and I'll give you Ashcrow Gloves + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4. Kalahkan 50 Death Cows dan 30 Devils, dan aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Gloves + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 4. Defeat 50 Death Cows and 30 Devils, and I'll give you Iris Gloves + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4. Kalahkan 50 Death Cows dan 30 Devils, dan aku akan memberimu Iris Gloves + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7 and defeat 50 Death Gorgons and 10 Balrogs. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7 dan kalahkan 50 Death Gorgons dan 10 Balrogs. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7 and defeat 50 Death Knights and 50 Death Gorgons. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7 dan kalahkan 50 Death Knights dan 50 Death Gorgons. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7 and defeat 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, and 20 Balrogs. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7 dan kalahkan 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, dan 20 Balrogs. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Gorgons and 10 Balrogs, and I'll give you an Ashcrow Armor + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Gorgons dan 10 Balrogs, dan aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Armor + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Gorgons and 10 Balrogs, and I'll give you an Iris Armor + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Gorgons dan 10 Balrogs, dan aku akan memberimu Iris Armor + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Knights and 30 Death Gorgons, and I'll give you Ashcrow Pants + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Knights dan 30 Death Gorgons, dan aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Pants + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Knights and 30 Death Gorgons, and I'll give you Iris Pants + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Knights dan 30 Death Gorgons, dan aku akan memberimu Iris Pants + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, and 20 Balrogs, and I'll give you a Crystal Sword + 7 + Skill as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, dan 20 Balrogs, dan aku akan memberimu Crystal Sword + 7 + Skill sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Level 7. Defeat 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, and 20 Balrogs, and I'll give you an Aquagold Crossbow + 7 + Skill as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 7. Kalahkan 50 Death Knights, 30 Death Gorgons, dan 20 Balrogs, dan aku akan memberimu Aquagold Crossbow + 7 + Skill sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 2 and 3. Defeat 60 Death Cows and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 2, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 2 dan 3. Kalahkan 60 Death Cows dan kembalilah ke Shadow Phantom Soldier untuk menerima Devil's Invitation + 2, yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Devil Square.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 3 and 4 and defeat 100 Death Cows. I'll give you Ancient Pants + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 3 dan 4 dan kalahkan 100 Death Cows. Aku akan memberimu Ancient Pants + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 3 and 4 and defeat 100 Death Cows. I'll give you Eclipse Pants + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 3 dan 4 dan kalahkan 100 Death Cows. Aku akan memberimu Eclipse Pants + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 3 and 4 and defeat 100 Death Cows. I'll give you an Ashcrow Armor + 7 and a Chaos Dragon Axe + 4 + Option as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 3 dan 4 dan kalahkan 100 Death Cows. Aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Armor + 7 dan Chaos Dragon Axe + 4 + Option sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 3 and 4 and defeat 100 Death Cows. I'll give you an Iris Armor + 7 and a Chaos Dragon Axe + 4 + Option as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 3 dan 4 dan kalahkan 100 Death Cows. Aku akan memberimu Iris Armor + 7 dan Chaos Dragon Axe + 4 + Option sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 3 and 4 and defeat 100 Death Cows. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 3 dan 4 dan kalahkan 100 Death Cows. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 and 5 and defeat 100 Devils. I'll give you Ashcrow Boots + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 dan 5 dan kalahkan 100 Devils. Aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Boots + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 and 5 and defeat 100 Devils. I'll give you Iris Boots + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 dan 5 dan kalahkan 100 Devils. Aku akan memberimu Iris Boots + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 through 6 and defeat 100 Devils. I'll give you an Ancient Armor + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 sampai 6 dan kalahkan 100 Devils. Aku akan memberimu Ancient Armor + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 through 6 and defeat 100 Devils. I'll give you an Eclipse Armor + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 sampai 6 dan kalahkan 100 Devils. Aku akan memberimu Eclipse Armor + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 through 6 and defeat 100 Devils. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 sampai 6 dan kalahkan 100 Devils. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 through 6, and you'll encounter Devils that use dark magic. Defeat 50 Devils and return to me for a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 sampai 6, dan kau akan menjumpai Devils yang menggunakan sihir gelap. Kalahkan 50 Devils dan kembalilah padaku untuk hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 4 through 6, and you'll encounter Devils that use dark magic. Defeat 60 Devils and return to me for a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 4 sampai 6, dan kau akan menjumpai Devils yang menggunakan sihir gelap. Kalahkan 60 Devils dan kembalilah padaku untuk hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 and defeat 100 Death Knights. I'll give you a Legendary Staff + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 5 sampai 7 dan kalahkan 100 Death Knights. Aku akan memberimu Legendary Staff + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 and defeat 100 Death Knights. I'll give you a Red Wing Stick + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 5 sampai 7 dan kalahkan 100 Death Knights. Aku akan memberimu Red Wing Stick + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 and defeat 100 Death Knights. I'll give you an Ashcrow Helm + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 5 sampai 7 dan kalahkan 100 Death Knights. Aku akan memberimu Ashcrow Helm + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 and defeat 100 Death Knights. I'll give you an Iris Helm + 8 as a reward.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 5 sampai 7 dan kalahkan 100 Death Knights. Aku akan memberimu Iris Helm + 8 sebagai hadiah.", "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 and defeat 100 Death Knights. Once that's done, you'll be able to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower Level 5 sampai 7 dan kalahkan 100 Death Knights. Setelah selesai, kau akan bisa menerima hadiah dari Shadow Phantom Soldier.", "Go to the Lost Tower. Defeat 80 Death Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 3, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": "Pergilah ke Lost Tower. Kalahkan 80 Death Knights dan kembalilah ke Shadow Phantom Soldier untuk menerima Invisibility Cloak + 3, yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Blood Castle.", "Go to the Swamp of Peace and defeat 100 Shadow Pawns. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier again to receive a choice between 30 Large SD Potions and 45 Large Complex Potions as your reward.": "Pergilah ke Swamp of Peace dan kalahkan 100 Shadow Pawns. Temui Shadow Phantom Soldier lagi untuk memilih antara 30 Large SD Potion dan 45 Large Complex Potion sebagai hadiahmu.", "Go to the Swamp of Peace. Defeat 140 Shadow Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 7, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": "Pergilah ke Swamp of Peace. Kalahkan 140 Shadow Knights dan kembalilah ke Shadow Phantom Soldier untuk menerima Devil's Invitation + 7, yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Devil Square.", "Go to the Swamp of Peace. Defeat 150 Shadow Looks and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 6, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": "Pergilah ke Swamp of Peace. Kalahkan 150 Shadow Looks dan kembalilah ke Shadow Phantom Soldier untuk menerima Scroll of Blood + 6, yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Illusion Temple.", "Go to the area between Tarkan 1 and Tarkan 2, and you will see these assassins known as Iron Wheels. Defeat 60 Iron Wheels and return to me for a reward.": "Pergilah ke area antara Tarkan 1 dan Tarkan 2, dan kau akan melihat para assassin bernama Iron Wheels ini. Kalahkan 60 Iron Wheels dan kembalilah padaku untuk hadiah.", "Good decision. The first mission for the second trial involves defeating 10 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Soul, a Jewel of Chaos, or a Jewel of Harmony.": "Keputusan tepat. Misi pertama ujian kedua mencakup mengalahkan 10 Guardsmen di Chaos Castle, mengantarkan senjata Archangel di Blood Castle, dan bertahan sampai akhir Devil Square. Selesaikan misinya dan kau akan dihadiahi salah satu dari Jewel of Bless, Jewel of Soul, Jewel of Chaos, atau Jewel of Harmony.", "Good decision. The first mission of the fifth trial involves surviving in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Life, a Jewel of Harmony, or two Jewels of Soul.": "Keputusan tepat. Misi pertama ujian kelima mencakup bertahan hidup di Chaos Castle, mengantarkan senjata Archangel di Blood Castle, dan bertahan sampai akhir Devil Square. Selesaikan misinya dan kau akan dihadiahi salah satu dari Jewel of Bless, Jewel of Life, Jewel of Harmony, atau dua Jewel of Soul.", "Good decision. The first mission of the fourth trial involves defeating 30 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Life, a Jewel of Harmony, or two Jewels of Soul.": "Keputusan tepat. Misi pertama ujian keempat mencakup mengalahkan 30 Guardsmen di Chaos Castle, mengantarkan senjata Archangel di Blood Castle, dan bertahan sampai akhir Devil Square. Selesaikan misinya dan kau akan dihadiahi salah satu dari Jewel of Bless, Jewel of Life, Jewel of Harmony, atau dua Jewel of Soul.", "Good decision. The first mission of the last trial involves surviving in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete this mission successfully and you may be reborn as hero. Your fame will echo across the whole continent of MU. You'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, two Jewels of Life, or two Jewels of Soul upon completion.": "Keputusan tepat. Misi pertama ujian terakhir mencakup bertahan hidup di Chaos Castle, mengantarkan senjata Archangel di Blood Castle, dan bertahan sampai akhir Devil Square. Selesaikan misi ini dengan sukses dan kau boleh dilahirkan kembali sebagai pahlawan. Ketenaranmu akan bergema di seluruh benua MU. Kau akan dihadiahi salah satu dari Jewel of Bless, dua Jewel of Life, atau dua Jewel of Soul setelah selesai.", "Good decision. This mission requires you to raise your worth by claiming victory in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 800,000 Exp.": "Keputusan tepat. Misi ini menuntutmu meningkatkan nilaimu dengan meraih kemenangan di Illusion Temple. Selesaikan misinya dan kau akan dihadiahi 800.000 Exp.", "Good job. The energy of insanity is safely contained since Necrons and Death Centurions have been eliminated. But the portion they already absorbed has been transferred to Kundun so we need to directly attack him. Can you help us? (Lv. 350 - 400)": "Bagus. Energi kegilaan kini terkendali dengan aman karena Necrons dan Death Centurions telah dilenyapkan. Tapi porsi yang telah mereka serap sudah dialihkan ke Kundun jadi kita harus menyerangnya langsung. Bisakah kau membantu kami? (Lv. 350 - 400)", "Good job. You made it easier for us to protect the temple entrance. The 2nd goal is to punish the enemies attacking the sealed stone. Etramu saved the empire by changing his body into a sealed stone, but his soul is getting engulfed with madness. Do you want to proceed? (Lv. 350 - 400)": "Bagus. Kau mempermudah kami menjaga pintu masuk kuil. Tujuan ke-2 adalah menghukum musuh-musuh yang menyerang batu perangkap. Etramu menyelamatkan kekaisaran dengan mengubah tubuhnya menjadi batu perangkap, tapi jiwanya kini dilanda kegilaan. Apa kau mau lanjut? (Lv. 350 - 400)", "Grand Wizard Etramu vowed to destroy Illusion Sorcery and formed an army to subjugate its followers. Under Etramu's command, the alliance engaged the followers of Illusion Sorcery with formidable force. Despite having been driven all the way back to Illusion Temple, the followers continued to resist. As battle raged on, Lev disappeared and left the followers of Illusion Sorcery in confusion. Ultimately, they all met their death at the hands of the alliance on the temple grounds.": "Grand Wizard Etramu bersumpah menghancurkan Illusion Sorcery dan membentuk pasukan untuk menaklukkan para pengikutnya. Di bawah komando Etramu, aliansi melawan para pengikut Illusion Sorcery dengan kekuatan besar. Meski telah didesak mundur sampai ke Illusion Temple, para pengikut itu tetap melawan. Saat pertempuran berkecamuk, Lev menghilang dan meninggalkan para pengikut Illusion Sorcery dalam kebingungan. Pada akhirnya, mereka semua tewas di tangan aliansi di area kuil.", "Great! I finally get the chance to show off what I can do.": "Hebat! Akhirnya aku dapat kesempatan untuk memamerkan kemampuanku.", "Great! I'll finish this tutorial in no time!": "Hebat! Tutorial ini akan kuselesaikan sekejap!", "Have you been to Chaos Castle? If not, it'll be an excellent opportunity to prove your strength. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (Basic character: Level 50-119, Advanced character: Level 30-99)": "Pernahkah kau ke Chaos Castle? Jika belum, ini kesempatan bagus untuk membuktikan kekuatanmu. Mengapa kau tidak mendengarkan dulu apa yang kukatakan lalu memutuskan? (Karakter dasar: Level 50-119, Karakter lanjutan: Level 30-99)", "Have you cleared today's request? Show me Lv. 1 Request Completion Certificate then.": "Sudahkah kau menyelesaikan permintaan hari ini? Tunjukkan Lv. 1 Request Completion Certificate padaku kalau begitu.", "Have you ever heard of Blood Castle's barrier? Would you like to hear Archangel's request to help defend Blood Castle's barrier and join in the fight for the castle? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": "Pernahkah kau mendengar tentang penghalang Blood Castle? Mau mendengar permintaan Archangel untuk membantu mempertahankan penghalang Blood Castle dan ikut bertarung demi kastil? (Karakter dasar: Level 15-80, Karakter lanjutan: Level 10-60)", "Have you ever heard of Blood Castle's barrier? Would you like to hear Archangel's request to help defend Blood Castle's barrier and join the fight for the castle? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": "Pernahkah kau mendengar tentang penghalang Blood Castle? Mau mendengar permintaan Archangel untuk membantu mempertahankan penghalang Blood Castle dan ikut bertarung demi kastil? (Karakter dasar: Level 81-130, Karakter lanjutan: Level 61-110)", "Have you ever heard of Illusion Temple and the ancient relics hidden there? It's a place where travelers can find both wealth and fame. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (All characters: Level 220-270)": "Pernahkah kau mendengar tentang Illusion Temple dan peninggalan kuno yang tersembunyi di sana? Itu tempat para pengembara bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Mengapa kau tidak mendengarkan dulu apa yang kukatakan lalu memutuskan? (Semua karakter: Level 220-270)", "Have you ever heard of Illusion Temple and the ancient relics hidden there? It's a place where travelers can find both wealth and fame. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (All characters: Level 271-320)": "Pernahkah kau mendengar tentang Illusion Temple dan peninggalan kuno yang tersembunyi di sana? Itu tempat para pengembara bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Mengapa kau tidak mendengarkan dulu apa yang kukatakan lalu memutuskan? (Semua karakter: Level 271-320)", "Having set his eyes on the tree's power of birth, Secrarium corrupted the Elf Tree and transformed it into an Immoral Tree that gave birth to monsters.  The monsters horde grew to astronomical proportions, and the kingdoms of the MU continent combined their forces to entrap the immoral tree in a space of nothingness.": "Setelah mengincar kekuatan kelahiran pohon itu, Secrarium merusak Elf Tree dan mengubahnya menjadi Immoral Tree yang melahirkan monster. Kawanan monster tumbuh hingga luar biasa besarnya, dan kerajaan-kerajaan di benua MU menggabungkan kekuatan mereka untuk menjebak pohon jahat itu di ruang kehampaan.", "Having trustworthy comrades at your side makes all the difference when it comes to Blood Castle quests. However, it will still be hard for you to obtain an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 331-400, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": "Punya rekan yang bisa dipercaya di sisimu membuat perbedaan besar dalam misi Blood Castle. Namun, tetap akan sulit bagimu untuk mendapatkan Invisibility Cloak yang sesuai levelmu. Aku punya misi yang akan memberimu item yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Blood Castle. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 331-400, Karakter lanjutan: Level 311-400)", "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Blood Castle challenge. Successfully complete the Blood Castle quest to receive a valuable reward.": "Dengarkan apa yang dikatakan Shadow Phantom Soldier dan ambil tantangan Blood Castle. Selesaikan misi Blood Castle dengan sukses untuk menerima hadiah berharga.", "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Chaos Castle challenge. If you survive Chaos Castle, you can claim a hefty reward.": "Dengarkan apa yang dikatakan Shadow Phantom Soldier dan ambil tantangan Chaos Castle. Jika kau bertahan di Chaos Castle, kau bisa mengklaim hadiah besar.", "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Devil Square challenge. Training at Devil Square will earn you a valuable reward.": "Dengarkan apa yang dikatakan Shadow Phantom Soldier dan ambil tantangan Devil Square. Berlatih di Devil Square akan memberimu hadiah berharga.", "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Illusion Temple challenge. Win at Illusion Temple to claim a valuable reward.": "Dengarkan apa yang dikatakan Shadow Phantom Soldier dan ambil tantangan Illusion Temple. Menang di Illusion Temple untuk mengklaim hadiah berharga.", "Help the reconnaissance party....": "Bantulah pasukan pengintai....", "Here is the Letter of Request for you. Right click on the letter to check the information. Please note that you cannot receive refund of 500,000 Zen deposit if you give up the quest. You also need to bring the 'Request Completion Certificate' to get the refund. Once again, you need to press (T) and click 'Start Quest' button at the bottom to check the information again once you close the information window. Good bye, then.": "Ini Letter of Request untukmu. Klik kanan pada surat itu untuk memeriksa informasinya. Perhatikan bahwa kau tidak bisa menerima pengembalian deposit 500.000 Zen jika kau menyerah pada misi. Kau juga perlu membawa 'Request Completion Certificate' untuk mendapat pengembalian dana. Sekali lagi, kau perlu menekan (T) dan klik tombol 'Start Quest' di bagian bawah untuk memeriksa informasi lagi setelah kau menutup jendela informasi. Sampai jumpa.", "Here it is.": "Ini dia.", "Here you go.": "Ini untukmu.", "Here's your first question.;How do you trade with a character that's in front of you?": "Ini pertanyaan pertamamu.;Bagaimana cara berdagang dengan karakter yang ada di depanmu?", "Heroic Courage": "Keberanian Heroik", "Heroic Fighting Spirit": "Semangat Juang Heroik", "Heroic Mentality": "Mental Heroik", "Heroic Qualities": "Kualitas Heroik", "Heroic Tenacity": "Ketangguhan Heroik", "Hi, I'm Priestess Beina, protector of this Underwater Temple. The sealed stone got stronger thanks to your effort, but Kundun's army is also getting stronger now. We investigated the sealed stone and found that Kundun's army absorbs its energy while Etramu's soul is taking a rest. Please help us and confine the energy of insanity within the sealed stone. (Lv. 350 - 400)": "Hai, aku Priestess Beina, penjaga Underwater Temple ini. Batu perangkap makin kuat berkat usahamu, tapi pasukan Kundun juga kini makin kuat. Kami menyelidiki batu perangkap dan menemukan bahwa pasukan Kundun menyerap energinya saat jiwa Etramu beristirahat. Tolong bantu kami dan kurung energi kegilaan di dalam batu perangkap. (Lv. 350 - 400)", "Hi, I'm Priestess Beina, protector of this Underwater Temple. This temple is Kundun's first target since Etramu keeps his body in the sealed stone. We're always short of fighters so I request help to the mercenary guild. Would you check the request? (Lv. 350 - 400)": "Hai, aku Priestess Beina, penjaga Underwater Temple ini. Kuil ini adalah target pertama Kundun karena Etramu menyimpan tubuhnya di batu perangkap. Kami selalu kekurangan pejuang jadi aku meminta bantuan pada guild tentara bayaran. Maukah kau memeriksa permintaannya? (Lv. 350 - 400)", "Hidden history of the rebellion": "Sejarah tersembunyi pemberontakan", "High ranking monsters deep inside the Lost Tower have launched a surprise attack on our reconnaissance party. Under the captain's orders to retaliate, we are now forming a punishment force. Will you accept this quest? (Level 206-209)": "Monster-monster berpangkat tinggi di terdalam Lost Tower melancarkan serangan mendadak ke pasukan pengintai kita. Di bawah perintah kapten untuk membalas, kami kini membentuk pasukan penghukum. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Level 206-209)", "Hmm, Letter of Request……": "Hmm, Letter of Request……", "Hmm, free mercenary……": "Hmm, tentara bayaran bebas……", "Hmm... that doesn't sound all that bad.": "Hmm... kedengarannya tidak terlalu buruk.", "Hmm... you are a wise warrior. Go now and achieve great things in the name Gens Vanert, knowing that I will always be here to assist you.": "Hmm... kau prajurit yang bijak. Pergilah sekarang dan raih hal-hal besar atas nama Gens Vanert, sadarlah bahwa aku akan selalu ada di sini untuk membantumu.", "Hmm...First, press M and then...": "Hmm...Pertama, tekan M lalu...", "Hmm...a test...": "Hmm...sebuah ujian...", "Hold on, I will find a quest suitable for you. Wait a moment please. (Level 260-289)": "Tunggu, aku akan mencari misi yang cocok untukmu. Sebentar ya. (Level 260-289)", "Hold on, I will find a quest suitable for you. Wait a moment please. (Level 290-319)": "Tunggu, aku akan mencari misi yang cocok untukmu. Sebentar ya. (Level 290-319)", "Hold on, I will find a quest suitable for you. Wait a moment please. (Level 320-349)": "Tunggu, aku akan mencari misi yang cocok untukmu. Sebentar ya. (Level 320-349)", "How can I turn him down...?;Alright, let's give it a try!": "Bagaimana aku bisa menolaknya...?;Baiklah, mari kita coba!", "How do I check coordinates?": "Bagaimana cara memeriksa koordinat?", "How do I get it?": "Bagaimana cara mendapatkannya?", "How do you do? I am Gregory, the Gens Duprian Steward. What is your business with our gens?": "Apa kabar? Aku Gregory, Gens Duprian Steward. Ada urusan apa kau dengan gens kami?", "How have you been? On behalf of the master of our clan, I thank you for answering the call of the clan. I personally hate to let the wandering mercenaries do this job, so I requested to send someone of the clan. I hope this didn't offend you. (Lv. 350 - 400)": "Apa kabar? Atas nama tuan klan kami, aku berterima kasih kau telah menanggapi panggilan klan. Aku pribadi tak suka membiarkan tentara bayaran pengembara melakukan tugas ini, jadi aku meminta dikirim seseorang dari klan. Aku harap ini tidak menyinggung perasaanmu. (Lv. 350 - 400)", "How much is the registration fee and the deposit?": "Berapa biaya pendaftaran dan depositnya?", "How will you help, exactly?": "Bagaimana tepatnya kau akan membantu?", "However, journeys such as this are bound to be perilous.;If you wish, we can provide you with a simple tutorial. What do you say?": "Namun, perjalanan seperti ini pasti penuh bahaya.;Jika kau mau, kami bisa memberimu tutorial sederhana. Bagaimana?", "Hunt down 10 Spiders from around town, and I'll give you a reward.": "Buru 10 Spiders di sekitar kota, dan aku akan memberimu hadiah.", "Hunting down measly Spiders is beneath me. (Refuse)": "Memburu Spiders remeh seperti itu di bawah derajatku. (Tolak)", "Hunting down monsters....": "Memburu monster....", "Hunting monsters will earn you EXP points, drop items, and Zens.": "Memburu monster akan memberimu poin EXP, item drop, dan Zen.", "I accept the mission. (Accept)": "Aku menerima misinya. (Terima)", "I accept your quest. (Accept)": "Aku menerima misimu. (Terima)", "I already knew that.": "Aku sudah tahu itu.", "I already knew that. What's the next quest?": "Aku sudah tahu itu. Apa misi berikutnya?", "I am not ready yet. (Refuse)": "Aku belum siap. (Tolak)", "I can almost see the end! (Accept)": "Aku hampir bisa melihat akhirnya! (Terima)", "I can't pass up on this. (Accept)": "Aku tak bisa melewatkan ini. (Terima)", "I didn't mean to pester you. But as the clan gets stronger, so do you. Please come back if you change your mind. (The quest has been cancelled.)": "Aku tak bermaksud mengganggumu. Tapi seiring klan makin kuat, kau pun ikut makin kuat. Silakan kembali jika kau berubah pikiran. (Misi telah dibatalkan.)", "I don't feel like doing it. (Refuse)": "Aku lagi tidak ingin melakukannya. (Tolak)", "I don't have the time right now. (Refuse)": "Aku tidak ada waktu sekarang. (Tolak)", "I don't have the time right now. I'll do it next time.": "Aku tidak ada waktu sekarang. Akan kulakukan lain kali.", "I don't have the time. I'm sorry. (Refuse)": "Aku tidak ada waktu. Maaf. (Tolak)", "I don't have time right now. I'll come back later. (Refuse)": "Aku tidak ada waktu sekarang. Aku akan kembali lagi nanti. (Tolak)", "I don't know how this story can help me. (Refuse)": "Aku tak tahu bagaimana cerita ini bisa membantuku. (Tolak)", "I don't need to be judged like this! (Refuse)": "Aku tak perlu dihakimi seperti ini! (Tolak)", "I don't think I have time for that right now. (Refuse)": "Sepertinya aku tidak punya waktu untuk itu sekarang. (Tolak)", "I don't want to decide right now. Just describe them for me.": "Aku belum ingin memutuskan sekarang. Jelaskan saja padaku.", "I give up. Going any further is beyond me. (Refuse)": "Aku menyerah. Melangkah lebih jauh lagi di luar kemampuanku. (Tolak)", "I got it!": "Aku mengerti!", "I guess Lugard was tricked by Secrarium. How do I participate?": "Sepertinya Lugard dikelabui Secrarium. Bagaimana cara aku ikut?", "I have a monster hunt quest that will take you deeper into the Dungeon than before. Will you accept this quest? (Level 101-110)": "Aku punya misi berburu monster yang akan membawamu lebih dalam ke Dungeon daripada sebelumnya. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Level 101-110)", "I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": "Aku punya misi yang akan memberimu item yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Blood Castle. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 131-180, Karakter lanjutan: Level 111-160)", "I have a quest that will take you deep inside the Dungeon. It'll be harder than last time, but there's a better reward. Will you accept this quest? (Level 121-130)": "Aku punya misi yang akan membawamu jauh ke dalam Dungeon. Ini akan lebih sulit dari terakhir kali, tapi ada hadiah yang lebih baik. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Level 121-130)", "I have a quest that will take you deep inside the Dungeon. There have been reports of monsters attempting to make their way above ground under the command of Gorgons. I want you to defeat these monsters. (Level 111-120)": "Aku punya misi yang akan membawamu jauh ke dalam Dungeon. Ada laporan monster yang berusaha naik ke permukaan di bawah komando Gorgons. Aku ingin kau mengalahkan monster-monster ini. (Level 111-120)", "I have a simple quest that will earn you a Scroll of Blood, which will grant you access to Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Level 321-350)": "Aku punya misi sederhana yang akan memberimu Scroll of Blood, yang memberimu akses ke Illusion Temple. Maukah kau menerima? (Semua karakter: Level 321-350)", "I have a simple quest that will earn you an invitation granting you access to Devil Square. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": "Aku punya misi sederhana yang akan memberimu undangan yang memberi akses ke Devil Square. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 181-230, Karakter lanjutan: Level 161-210)", "I have no time right now. (Refuse)": "Aku tidak ada waktu sekarang. (Tolak)", "I have plenty of experience.;To each his own!": "Aku sudah banyak pengalaman.;Lain orang lain pula caranya!", "I hope you realize that a hero without a fighting spirit is merely a coward.": "Aku harap kau sadar bahwa pahlawan tanpa semangat juang hanyalah seorang pengecut.", "I know it well. I hear you need a special item to go there....": "Aku tahu betul. Kudengar kau butuh item khusus untuk pergi ke sana....", "I know it well. I hear you need an item to participate in the event....": "Aku tahu betul. Kudengar kau butuh sebuah item untuk ikut event....", "I learned a skill!": "Aku mempelajari sebuah skill!", "I need you to accept a small quest first as a test. Are you up to it? There is of course a reasonable reward for finishing.": "Aku mau kau menerima misi kecil dulu sebagai ujian. Kau sanggup? Tentu ada hadiah yang layak saat selesai.", "I neither have the skills nor the warriors I need to take on this quest. Give me more time.": "Aku belum punya kemampuan maupun prajurit yang kubutuhkan untuk misi ini. Beri aku waktu lagi.", "I regret we can't be of any help to you.;Here, at least take this present. I hope, the next time we meet, a great warrior stands before my eyes.;Enjoy your time out there.": "Aku menyesal kami tak bisa membantumu.;Ini, terimalah setidaknya hadiah ini. Aku harap, saat kita bertemu lagi, seorang prajurit hebat berdiri di hadapanku.;Nikmatilah waktu petualanganmu di luar sana.", "I respect your decision to go on this journey.;Allow me to teach you a few simple but essential things you need to know before your adventure in MU begins.": "Aku menghormati keputusanmu untuk pergi dalam perjalanan ini.;Izinkan aku mengajarkan beberapa hal sederhana tapi penting yang perlu kau tahu sebelum petualanganmu di MU dimulai.", "I see you've now mastered hunting. When you hunt monsters, you can employ normal attacks by left-clicking or use skill attacks by right-clicking.": "Aku lihat kau kini sudah menguasai berburu. Saat kau memburu monster, kau bisa menggunakan serangan normal dengan klik kiri atau serangan skill dengan klik kanan.", "I see you've successfully completed your first hunt! Did you find it difficult? Hunting monsters will earn you EXP points, drop items, and Zens.;You can pick up items dropped by defeated monsters using the mouse or automatically by pressing the space bar.": "Aku lihat kau telah berhasil menyelesaikan perburuan pertamamu! Apa kau merasa sulit? Memburu monster akan memberimu poin EXP, item drop, dan Zen.;Kau bisa mengambil item yang dijatuhkan monster yang dikalahkan dengan mouse atau secara otomatis dengan menekan tombol spasi.", "I see.": "Begitu.", "I see. How do I enter?": "Begitu. Bagaimana cara masuknya?", "I simply can't go on anymore. (Refuse)": "Aku benar-benar tak bisa melanjutkan lagi. (Tolak)", "I think I have enough courage already. (Refuse)": "Sepertinya aku sudah cukup punya keberanian. (Tolak)", "I think a quest involving the Dungeon, which is a headache for Lorencia, should be suitable for you. I want you to wipe out the monsters in the Dungeon, one by one. Will you accept this quest? (Level 91-100)": "Sepertinya misi yang melibatkan Dungeon, yang menjadi penyakit kepala bagi Lorencia, cocok untukmu. Aku mau kau habisi monster-monster di Dungeon, satu per satu. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Level 91-100)", "I trust you are quite used to Devil Square by now. However, obtaining an invitation to Devil Square remains a difficult task. Luckily, I have a quest that will earn you an invitation. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah cukup terbiasa dengan Devil Square. Namun, mendapatkan undangan ke Devil Square tetaplah tugas yang sulit. Untungnya, aku punya misi yang akan memberimu undangan. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 231-280, Karakter lanjutan: Level 211-260)", "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Blood Castle by now. You should now focus on building the bond between you and your comrades to the point where you can rely on each another unconditionally.": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah agak familiar dengan Blood Castle. Sekarang kau harus fokus memperkuat ikatan antara kau dan rekan-rekanmu sampai pada titik di mana kalian bisa saling bergantung tanpa syarat.", "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Chaos Castle by now. However, it should still be difficult for you to acquire the necessary item. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (Basic character: Level 240-299, Advanced character: Level 220-279)": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah agak familiar dengan Chaos Castle. Namun, tetap akan sulit bagimu untuk mendapatkan item yang diperlukan. Aku punya misi untukmu. Misi yang memberimu item-item yang kau butuhkan di Chaos Castle.... Maukah kau menerima? (Karakter dasar: Level 240-299, Karakter lanjutan: Level 220-279)", "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Chaos Castle by now. The event will now be even more challenging because you will face more powerful users and corrupt guardsmen.": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah agak familiar dengan Chaos Castle. Event ini kini akan lebih menantang karena kau akan menghadapi para pengguna yang lebih kuat dan guardsmen yang korup.", "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Devil Square by now. You'll now be moved to a place where even more powerful monsters spawn. There's no need to worry, however. You can expect rapid growth as long as you and your comrades execute coordinated attacks.": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah agak familiar dengan Devil Square. Kau kini akan dipindahkan ke tempat di mana monster yang lebih kuat lagi muncul. Tapi tak perlu khawatir. Kau bisa berharap pertumbuhan pesat selama kau dan rekan-rekanmu melakukan serangan terkoordinasi.", "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Illusion Temple by now. You'll now be moved to a place where even more powerful monsters spawn. There's no need to worry, however. You can expect rapid growth as long as you and your comrades learn to work together.": "Aku yakin kau kini sudah agak familiar dengan Illusion Temple. Kau kini akan dipindahkan ke tempat di mana monster yang lebih kuat lagi muncul. Tapi tak perlu khawatir. Kau bisa berharap pertumbuhan pesat selama kau dan rekan-rekanmu belajar bekerja sama.", "I understand well. What's the next quest?": "Aku mengerti. Apa misi berikutnya?", "I understand.": "Aku mengerti.", "I understand. I will do what I can.": "Aku mengerti. Aku akan melakukan yang kubisa.", "I want to be an Elf who focuses on defense!": "Aku ingin menjadi Elf yang fokus pada pertahanan!", "I want to be an Elf who focuses on wizardry!": "Aku ingin menjadi Elf yang fokus pada sihir!", "I want to hear more. (Accept)": "Aku ingin mendengar lebih lanjut. (Terima)", "I will give you a quest that will earn you the item you need to enter the event. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 120-179, Advanced character: Level 100-159)": "Aku akan memberimu misi yang akan memberimu item yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki event. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 120-179, Karakter lanjutan: Level 100-159)", "I will give you the queen's gifts if you pass a test to see if there's anything else you need to know and if you have the basic knowledge to travel throughout the MU realm. How about it?": "Aku akan memberimu hadiah sang ratu jika kau lulus ujian untuk melihat apakah ada lagi yang perlu kau tahu dan apakah kau punya pengetahuan dasar untuk menjelajahi seluruh dunia MU. Bagaimana?", "I will guide you through MU game play.": "Aku akan memandu permainan MU-mu.", "I will help you. Tell me what to do. (Accept)": "Aku akan membantumu. Katakan apa yang harus kulakukan. (Terima)", "I will inform you when a request of your level is delivered. Thank you.": "Aku akan memberitahumu saat permintaan yang sesuai levelmu tiba. Terima kasih.", "I will sign up. (Accept)": "Aku akan mendaftar. (Terima)", "I will teach you basic hunting and controls through a simple tutorial.;It's not that difficult, and I'm sure you'll finish it in no time.": "Aku akan mengajarimu dasar berburu dan kontrol lewat tutorial sederhana.;Tidak sesulit itu, dan aku yakin kau akan menyelesaikannya sekejap.", "I will teach you hunting and control commands through a simple tutorial.": "Aku akan mengajarimu berburu dan perintah kontrol lewat tutorial sederhana.", "I will tell you then. Devildom's royal guards, who were summoned when Kundun succumbed to Secrarium, posed a great threat to the heaven world. To protect their base, the Twelve Saints formed a barrier around Blood Castle.": "Aku akan ceritakan nanti. Pengawal kerajaan Devildom, yang dipanggil saat Kundun tunduk pada Secrarium, menjadi ancaman besar bagi dunia atas. Untuk melindungi markas mereka, Dua Belas Orang Suci membentuk penghalang di sekeliling Blood Castle.", "I'd rather you give me the gifts without the test.": "Aku lebih suka kau memberiku hadiahnya tanpa ujian.", "I'll explain this in more detail. What else do you wish to know?": "Aku akan jelaskan ini lebih rinci. Apa lagi yang ingin kau tahu?", "I'll give you a full briefing when you're ready, then. May the grace of God be with you… (The quest has been cancelled)": "Aku akan memberimu penjelasan lengkap saat kau sudah siap, kalau begitu. Semoga anugerah Tuhan menyertaimu… (Misi telah dibatalkan)", "I'll give you a full briefing when you're ready, then. May the grace of God be with you… (The quest has been cancelled.)": "Aku akan memberimu penjelasan lengkap saat kau sudah siap, kalau begitu. Semoga anugerah Tuhan menyertaimu… (Misi telah dibatalkan.)", "I'll head for Vulcanus immediately. (Accept)": "Aku akan segera menuju Vulcanus. (Terima)", "I'll just take the queen's gifts without taking the test.": "Aku akan ambil hadiah sang ratu saja tanpa mengikuti ujian.", "I'll stay focused until the very end! (Accept)": "Aku akan tetap fokus sampai akhir! (Terima)", "I'll test you to see if you have the basic knowledge required for travel throughout the MU empire and give you the queen's gifts if you pass.": "Aku akan mengujimu untuk melihat apakah kau punya pengetahuan dasar yang diperlukan untuk menjelajahi seluruh kekaisaran MU dan memberimu hadiah sang ratu jika kau lulus.", "I'm always up for hunting down monsters....": "Aku selalu siap memburu monster....", "I'm busy now. I'll come back later. (Refuse)": "Aku sedang sibuk sekarang. Aku akan kembali lagi nanti. (Tolak)", "I'm glad we can help. We aren't difficult to find.;Simply look for and talk to the Shadow Phantom Soldier in any of the towns.": "Aku senang kami bisa membantu. Kami tidak sulit ditemukan.;Cari saja dan bicaralah dengan Shadow Phantom Soldier di kota mana pun.", "I'm here for your request.": "Aku datang untuk permintaanmu.", "I'm not ready yet. Please wait. (Refuse)": "Aku belum siap. Mohon tunggu. (Tolak)", "I'm sorry to hear that. There are many ways to become stronger, but they'll all take time. Remember that well.": "Aku menyesal mendengarnya. Ada banyak cara untuk menjadi lebih kuat, tapi semuanya butuh waktu. Ingat itu baik-baik.", "I'm sorry to hear that. You can't repeat the first mission if you abandon the second mission. You must complete the second mission before you can repeat the first mission. Please return if you change your mind.": "Aku menyesal mendengarnya. Kau tak bisa mengulang misi pertama jika kau meninggalkan misi kedua. Kau harus menyelesaikan misi kedua sebelum bisa mengulang misi pertama. Silakan kembali jika kau berubah pikiran.", "I'm sorry. I don't have the time right now. (Refuse)": "Maaf. Aku tidak ada waktu sekarang. (Tolak)", "I'm sorry. I don't have the time. (Refuse)": "Maaf. Aku tidak ada waktu. (Tolak)", "I'm sure you are well aware of Kundun. The weakest and most disorganized monsters of Kundun's army are frequently attacking and plundering civilians just outside of town. I wanted to ask you to eliminate these plundering monsters.... Will you accept this quest? (Level 15-25)": "Aku yakin kau sudah kenal Kundun dengan baik. Monster-monster terlemah dan paling kacau dalam pasukan Kundun sering menyerang dan merampok warga sipil di luar kota. Aku ingin memintamu melenyapkan monster-monster perampok ini.... Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Level 15-25)", "I'm sure you have a long trail of defeated monsters behind you. However, travelers widely vary in terms of their skills. If you're unsure of your own skills, proving yourself at Chaos Castle should give you some clarity. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (All characters: Master Level)": "Aku yakin kau punya jejak panjang monster yang telah dikalahkan di belakangmu. Namun, kemampuan tiap pengembara sangat berbeda-beda. Jika kau belum yakin dengan kemampuanmu sendiri, membuktikan dirimu di Chaos Castle seharusnya memberimu gambaran. Aku punya misi untukmu. Misi yang memberimu item-item yang kau butuhkan di Chaos Castle.... Maukah kau menerima? (Semua karakter: Master Level)", "I'm too busy to help right now.": "Aku terlalu sibuk untuk membantu sekarang.", "Ice Walkers are attacking and weakening the barrier that was formed to separate La Cleon and Devias from one another. Go to La Cleon and defeat 120 Ice Walkers. Come see me once that's done to receive a Devil's Invitation + 6 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": "Ice Walkers menyerang dan melemahkan penghalang yang dibentuk untuk memisahkan La Cleon dan Devias satu sama lain. Pergilah ke La Cleon dan kalahkan 120 Ice Walkers. Temui aku setelah selesai untuk menerima Devil's Invitation + 6 sebagai hadiah. Mereka musuh yang kuat, sebaiknya kau berburu dengan bantuan orang lain.", "If you are an Agility Elf, whose priority is defense, you can equip a weapon and use its skills. If you are an Energy Elf, whose priority is wizardry, you can purchase orbs to learn skills.": "Jika kau adalah Agility Elf, yang mengutamakan pertahanan, kau bisa memasang senjata dan menggunakan skill-skillnya. Jika kau adalah Energy Elf, yang mengutamakan sihir, kau bisa membeli orb untuk mempelajari skill.", "If you are equipped with a weapon imbued with a skill, you can activate that skill by assigning it to the Skill window.": "Jika kau memakai senjata yang dipenuhi skill, kau bisa mengaktifkan skill itu dengan memindahkannya ke jendela Skill.", "If you are equipped with a weapon imbued with a skill, you can activate that skill by assigning it to the Skill window.;Can you see the numbered slots at the bottom center of the screen? Click on the icon outlined in green, to the right of the number five slot.": "Jika kau memakai senjata yang dipenuhi skill, kau bisa mengaktifkan skill itu dengan memindahkannya ke jendela Skill.;Kau lihat slot bernomor di tengah bawah layar? Klik ikon yang dilingkari garis hijau, di sebelah kanan slot nomor lima.", "If you don't want to receive party requests while hunting, simply type in 'Party off' in the Chat window. To start receiving party requests again, type in 'Request on' in the Chat window.": "Jika kau tidak ingin menerima permintaan party saat berburu, cukup ketik 'Party off' di jendela Chat. Untuk mulai menerima permintaan party lagi, ketik 'Request on' di jendela Chat.", "If you find yourself far away from a town or cornered while on a hunt, the Town Portal Scroll can come in really handy.": "Jika kau berada jauh dari kota atau terpojok saat berburu, Town Portal Scroll bisa sangat berguna.", "If you leave the gens, your contribution will be reset.;Do you still wish to leave?": "Jika kau meninggalkan gens, kontribusimu akan direset.;Apakah kau tetap ingin keluar?", "If you want to find out when you can enter, simply move your mouse over the Armor of Guardsman. If you want to enter, simply right-click on the armor at a designated time. Come see me when you have time, and I will give you a quest that will earn you the item needed to enter the event.": "Jika kau ingin tahu kapan kau bisa masuk, cukup arahkan mouse-mu ke Armor of Guardsman. Jika kau ingin masuk, cukup klik kanan pada armor itu pada waktu yang ditentukan. Temui aku saat kau punya waktu, dan aku akan memberimu misi yang akan memberimu item yang dibutuhkan untuk memasuki event.", "Illusion Spells, the foundation of Illusion Sorcery, was discovered by an Archaeologist named Mirage. Mirage found the spells' power to be too dangerous and sealed it. His partner Lev, however, stole the spells to brainwash people and establish Illusion Sorcery. Illusion Sorcery gradually grew larger and brought chaos to the continent.": "Illusion Spells, fondasi Illusion Sorcery, ditemukan oleh seorang Arkeolog bernama Mirage. Mirage mendapati kekuatan mantra itu terlalu berbahaya dan menyegelnya. Namun, rekannya Lev mencuri mantra itu untuk mencuci otak orang dan mendirikan Illusion Sorcery. Illusion Sorcery lambat laun makin besar dan membawa kekacauan ke benua.", "Illusion Temple Adaptation (1)": "Adaptasi Illusion Temple (1)", "Illusion Temple Adaptation (2)": "Adaptasi Illusion Temple (2)", "Illusion Temple Adaptation (3)": "Adaptasi Illusion Temple (3)", "Illusion Temple Challenge (1)": "Tantangan Illusion Temple (1)", "Illusion Temple Challenge (2)": "Tantangan Illusion Temple (2)", "Illusion Temple Challenge (3)": "Tantangan Illusion Temple (3)", "Illusion Temple is a place where you can acquire items and equipment for fast growth. If you wish to possess such items and equipment for yourself, inquire with the Shadow Phantom Soldier about Illusion Temple.": "Illusion Temple adalah tempat di mana kau bisa memperoleh item dan perlengkapan untuk pertumbuhan cepat. Jika kau ingin memiliki item dan perlengkapan seperti itu, tanyakan pada Shadow Phantom Soldier tentang Illusion Temple.", "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 271-320)": "Illusion Temple adalah tempat di mana kau bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Jika kau mengambil tantangan kuil, kau mungkin memperoleh sesuatu yang penting untuk latihanmu. Maukah kau mengambil tantangannya? (Semua karakter: Level 271-320)", "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 321-350)": "Illusion Temple adalah tempat di mana kau bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Jika kau mengambil tantangan kuil, kau mungkin memperoleh sesuatu yang penting untuk latihanmu. Maukah kau mengambil tantangannya? (Semua karakter: Level 321-350)", "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 351-380)": "Illusion Temple adalah tempat di mana kau bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Jika kau mengambil tantangan kuil, kau mungkin memperoleh sesuatu yang penting untuk latihanmu. Maukah kau mengambil tantangannya? (Semua karakter: Level 351-380)", "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Master Level)": "Illusion Temple adalah tempat di mana kau bisa menemukan kekayaan sekaligus ketenaran. Jika kau mengambil tantangan kuil, kau mungkin memperoleh sesuatu yang penting untuk latihanmu. Maukah kau mengambil tantangannya? (Semua karakter: Master Level)", "Illusion Temple...": "Illusion Temple...", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest, but more than anything else solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (All characters: Master Level)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi, tapi di atas segalanya solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Semua karakter: Master Level)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 231-280, Karakter lanjutan: Level 211-260)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 131-180, Karakter lanjutan: Level 111-160)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 15-80, Karakter lanjutan: Level 10-60)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 181-230, Karakter lanjutan: Level 161-210)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 281-330, Karakter lanjutan: Level 261-310)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 331-400, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 331-400, Karakter lanjutan: Level 311-400)", "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": "Di Blood Castle, kau akan bertarung melawan waktu. Armor dan senjata yang bagus tentu akan membantumu menyelesaikan misi. Tapi di atas segalanya, solidaritas party-mulah yang akan menentukan di sana. Maukah kau menerima misi Archangel? (Karakter dasar: Level 81-130, Karakter lanjutan: Level 61-110)", "In MU, it's possible to combine different items to create new ones. In fact, trying out different combinations of items adds a whole new dimension to MU.;Whom should you seek out in order to combine items?": "Di MU, kau bisa menggabungkan item-item berbeda untuk menciptakan item baru. Sebenarnya, mencoba berbagai kombinasi item menambah dimensi baru sepenuhnya ke MU.;Kepada siapa kau harus mencari untuk menggabung item?", "In the MU world, you can use the M button to travel with ease, provided that your level is high enough and you have enough money for the destination. Discovering areas that are right for your level and hunting there can also be very fun.": "Di dunia MU, kau bisa menggunakan tombol M untuk bepergian dengan mudah, asalkan levelmu cukup tinggi dan kau punya cukup uang untuk tujuan itu. Menemukan area yang sesuai dengan levelmu dan berburu di sana juga bisa sangat menyenangkan.", "Inland Supply Route!": "Rute Pasokan Darat!", "Iron Riders have been launching guerilla attacks against our forces stationed throughout Kanturu Ruins. Eliminate these Iron Riders and relieve the stress of our gens members.": "Iron Riders telah melancarkan serangan gerilya terhadap pasukan kami yang ditempatkan di seluruh Kanturu Ruins. Lenyapkan Iron Riders ini dan hilangkan beban anggota gens kita.", "Is it time for me to return to the Dungeon?": "Apakah sudah waktunya aku kembali ke Dungeon?", "Is the bond of your Blood Castle party still strong? If not, I suggest you return to Blood Castle to strengthen it. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": "Apakah ikatan party Blood Castle-mu masih kuat? Jika tidak, saranku kembalilah ke Blood Castle untuk memperkuatnya. Aku punya misi yang akan memberimu item yang kau butuhkan untuk memasuki Blood Castle. Maukah kau menerima misi ini? (Karakter dasar: Level 231-280, Karakter lanjutan: Level 211-260)", "Is there anything I need to be cautious of?": "Apakah ada yang perlu aku waspadai?", "Is there anything I should be aware of about Illusion Temple?": "Apakah ada yang perlu aku ketahui tentang Illusion Temple?", "Is there anything I should know about Devil Square?": "Apakah ada yang perlu aku ketahui tentang Devil Square?", "It all makes sense now.": "Semuanya jadi masuk akal sekarang.", "It doesn't matter with the travelers, but you have to be careful when you kill a corrupt guardsman. Corrupt guardsmen will explode and may even push you off the arena. If this happens, you will be disqualified.": "Itu tidak masalah bagi para pengembara, tapi kau harus berhati-hati saat membunuh seorang guardsman korup. Guardsman korup akan meledak dan bahkan bisa mendorongmu jatuh dari arena. Jika ini terjadi, kau akan didiskualifikasi.", "It really is easy to enter. What does the event involve, exactly?": "Memang mudah untuk masuk. Sebenarnya, event ini mencakup apa?", "It seems Cursed Liches are tormenting the residents of Elveland with their dark spells and curses. Hunt down 40 of those Cursed Liches, and I'll give you a Devil's Invitation +1 as a reward. I suggest you work with others for faster results.": "Sepertinya Cursed Liches menyiksa penduduk Elveland dengan mantra gelap dan kutukan mereka. Buru 40 Cursed Liches itu, dan aku akan memberimu Devil's Invitation +1 sebagai hadiah. Saranku bekerjalah dengan orang lain untuk hasil yang lebih cepat.", "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (All characters: Master Level)": "Sepertinya kau memiliki prajurit perkasa yang bersedia bertempur di sisimu. Menghadapi tantangan Blood Castle bersama pasti akan mempererat ikatanmu dengan rekan-rekanmu. Maukah kau kembali ke Blood Castle dan menjalankan misi Archangel lainnya? (Semua karakter: Master Level)", "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": "Sepertinya kau memiliki prajurit perkasa yang bersedia bertempur di sisimu. Menghadapi tantangan Blood Castle bersama pasti akan mempererat ikatanmu dengan rekan-rekanmu. Maukah kau kembali ke Blood Castle dan menjalankan misi Archangel lainnya? (Karakter dasar: Level 131-180, Karakter lanjutan: Level 111-160)", "10-Hour Pass": "10-Hour Pass", "1st Lucky Armor Ticket": "1st Lucky Armor Ticket", "1st Lucky Boots Ticket": "1st Lucky Boots Ticket", "1st Lucky Gloves Ticket": "1st Lucky Gloves Ticket", "1st Lucky Helm Ticket": "1st Lucky Helm Ticket", "1st Lucky Pants Ticket": "1st Lucky Pants Ticket", "2nd Lucky Armor Ticket": "2nd Lucky Armor Ticket", "2nd Lucky Boots Ticket": "2nd Lucky Boots Ticket", "2nd Lucky Gloves Ticket": "2nd Lucky Gloves Ticket", "2nd Lucky Helm Ticket": "2nd Lucky Helm Ticket", "2nd Lucky Pants Ticket": "2nd Lucky Pants Ticket", "3-Hour Pass": "3-Hour Pass", "30-Day Pass": "30-Day Pass", "30-Day Pass - Points": "30-Day Pass - Points", "5-Hour Pass": "5-Hour Pass", "90-Day Pass": "90-Day Pass", "90-Day Pass - Points": "90-Day Pass - Points", "Absolute Scepter": "Absolute Scepter", "Absolute Weapon of Archangel": "Absolute Weapon of Archangel", "Abyssal Eye": "Abyssal Eye", "Adamantine Armor": "Adamantine Armor", "Adamantine Boots": "Adamantine Boots", "Adamantine Gloves": "Adamantine Gloves", "Adamantine Mask": "Adamantine Mask", "Adamantine Pants": "Adamantine Pants", "Aileen Bowr": "Aileen Bowr", "Albatross Bow": "Albatross Bow", "Ale": "Ale", "Amethyst Ring": "Amethyst Ring", "Ancient Armor": "Ancient Armor", "Ancient Boots": "Ancient Boots", "Ancient Gloves": "Ancient Gloves", "Ancient Helm": "Ancient Helm", "Ancient Pants": "Ancient Pants", "Ancient Stick": "Ancient Stick", "Angelic Staff": "Angelic Staff", "Antidote": "Antidote", "Apple"